  "text": "GeoRisk Philippines (GeoRiskPH) is a government-led, web-based platform providing authoritative, science-based hazard and risk information. It is designed to support multi-hazard data management, risk assessment, and risk-informed planning across various government levels. The platform consolidates hazard information and offers tools for exposure mapping and analytics, enabling accurate and standardized risk assessments.",
